<h2>Ars: Jurnal Seni Rupa dan Desain</h2>


<div id="content">


	<div id="journalDescription"><p><strong><em>Ars: Jurnal Seni Rupa dan Desain</em></strong> is a peer-reviewed journal published by the Faculty of Visual Arts and Design, Institut Seni Indonesia Yogyakarta, Indonesia. The journal aims to publish academic works in the form of research findings, artistic research, critical studies, and literature reviews in the fields of visual arts and design.</p><p><em>Ars: Jurnal Seni Rupa dan Desain</em> is published three times a year, covering the periods January-April, May-August, and September-December. All published articles are assigned a DOI (Digital Object Identifier).</p><p>Since Volume 21 Year 2018, <em>Ars</em> has been nationally accredited. Based on <strong>Keputusan Direktur Jenderal Riset dan Pengembangan Kementerian Pendidikan Tinggi, Sains, dan Teknologi Nomor 156/C/C3/KPT/2026 tentang Peringkat Akreditasi Baru Jurnal Ilmiah Peringkat 3 sampai 6 Periode 2 Tahun 2025</strong>, dated 7 April 2026, <em>Ars</em> has been <strong>re-accredited at SINTA 3</strong>. The official decree listing <em>Ars</em> can be accessed at: <br /> <a title="SINTA 3" href="https://arjuna.kemdiktisaintek.go.id/#/pengumuman/710" target="_blank">https://arjuna.kemdiktisaintek.go.id/#/pengumuman/710</a><br />(see Appendix number 65/<em>Lampiran nomor 65</em>).</p><p><em>Ars: Jurnal Seni Rupa dan Desain</em> is indexed by</p><p><a href="https://scholar.google.com/citations?user=fEDHWd8AAAAJ" target="_blank"><img src="/public/site/images/widodo/Google_Scholar.jpg" alt="Google Scholar" /></a> <a href="https://garuda.kemdiktisaintek.go.id/journal/view/5600" target="_blank"><img src="/public/site/images/widodo/GARUDA.jpg" alt="GARUDA" /></a> <a href="https://sinta.kemdiktisaintek.go.id/journals/profile/4633" target="_blank"><img src="/public/site/images/widodo/SINTA.jpg" alt="SINTA" /></a> <a href="https://catalogue.leidenuniv.nl/primo-explore/search?query=any,contains,1829-7412&amp;tab=all_content&amp;vid=UBL_V1&amp;offset=0&amp;sortby=rank&amp;pcAvailability=true" target="_blank"><img src="/public/site/images/widodo/Universiteit_Leiden.jpg" alt="Universiteit Leiden" /></a> <a href="https://hollis.harvard.edu/primo-explore/search?query=any,contains,1829-7412&amp;tab=everything&amp;search_scope=everything&amp;vid=HVD2&amp;lang=en_US&amp;offset=0" target="_blank"><img src="/public/site/images/widodo/Harvard_Library.jpg" alt="Harvard Library" /></a></p><p>p-ISSN: <a title="p-ISSN" href="https://portal.issn.org/resource/ISSN/1829-7412" target="_blank">1829-7412</a> <br />e-ISSN: <a title="e-ISSN" href="https://portal.issn.org/resource/ISSN/2580-7374" target="_blank">2580-7374</a></p><div> </div></div>



<br />
<div id="homepageImage"><img src="https://journal.isi.ac.id/public/journals/1/homepageImage_en_US.jpg" width="1061" height="1500" alt="Ars: Jurnal Seni Rupa dan Desain" /></div>

<br />
<div id="additionalHomeContent"><!-- Banner 1: Submission --><div style="border: 0.5px solid #f0a0c0; border-radius: 12px; overflow: hidden;"><div style="border-left: 4px solid #C2185B; padding: 2rem 2.5rem; background: #fff0f5; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: space-between; gap: 2rem; flex-wrap: wrap;"><!-- Left: Text content --><div style="flex: 1; min-width: 220px;"><p style="font-size: 15px; font-weight: bold; letter-spacing: 0.12em; color: #c2185b; margin: 0 0 0.5rem; text-transform: uppercase;">Submission</p><p style="font-size: 15px; color: #1a1a1a; margin: 0 0 0.6rem; line-height: 1.6;">Please log in to our website system using your username to begin a submission to <em>Ars: Jurnal Seni Rupa dan Desain</em> and click <span style="white-space: nowrap;">"New Submission"</span> in the Author role.</p><p style="font-size: 13px; color: #555; margin: 0; line-height: 1.6;">If you do not have a username, please register first by clicking the <strong style="color: #c2185b; font-weight: 500;">Register</strong> button.</p></div><!-- Right: Buttons --><div style="flex-shrink: 0; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 10px; align-items: stretch;"><a style="display: inline-flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; gap: 8px; padding: 10px 22px; border: 1px solid #C2185B; border-radius: 8px; font-size: 13px; font-weight: bold; color: #ffffff; text-decoration: none; background: #C2185B;" title="Log in to submit" href="/index.php/ars/login" target="_blank"> Log in to submit </a> <a style="display: inline-flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; gap: 8px; padding: 10px 22px; border: 1px solid #C2185B; border-radius: 8px; font-size: 13px; font-weight: 500; color: #c2185b; text-decoration: none; background: #fff0f5;" title="Register" href="/index.php/ars/user/register" target="_blank"> Register </a></div></div></div><!-- Banner 2: Roles reminder --><div style="border: 0.5px solid #f0a0c0; border-radius: 12px; overflow: hidden; margin-top: 1rem;"><div style="border-left: 4px solid #C2185B; padding: 1.5rem 2.5rem; background: #fff0f5; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: space-between; gap: 2rem; flex-wrap: wrap;"><!-- Left: Warning text --><p style="font-size: 13px; color: #555; margin: 0; line-height: 1.6; flex: 1; min-width: 220px;">⚠️ Do not forget to tick <strong style="color: #c2185b; font-weight: 500;">"Author"</strong> in the <strong style="color: #c2185b; font-weight: 600;">Roles</strong> selection in <a style="background: #ffd6e7; color: #c2185b; font-weight: 600; padding: 1px 6px; border-radius: 4px; text-decoration: none; white-space: nowrap;" href="/index.php/ars/user/profile#:~:text=%C2%A0%20Reader-,Author,-Bio%20Statement%0A(E" target="_blank">My Profile</a> to be able to submit a manuscript to <em>Ars: Jurnal Seni Rupa dan Desain</em>.</p><!-- Right: Roles widget --><div style="flex-shrink: 0; min-width: 150px; display: flex; flex-direction: column; align-items: center;"><div style="background: #ffffff; border: 0.5px solid #e0b0c8; border-radius: 8px; padding: 0.6rem 1rem; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 5px; box-shadow: 0 1px 4px rgba(194,24,91,0.06);"><p style="font-size: 10px; font-weight: bold; color: #c2185b; margin: 0 0 5px; letter-spacing: 0.08em; text-transform: uppercase;">Roles</p><label style="display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 7px; font-size: 12px; color: #555;"> <span style="width: 14px; height: 14px; border-radius: 3px; background: #9c6fad; display: inline-flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; flex-shrink: 0; color: white; font-size: 10px;"> ✓ </span> Reader </label> <label style="display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 7px; font-size: 12px; color: #1a1a1a; font-weight: 600;"> <span style="width: 14px; height: 14px; border-radius: 3px; background: #9c6fad; display: inline-flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; flex-shrink: 0; color: white; font-size: 10px;"> ✓ </span> Author </label></div></div></div></div></div>

		<div id="announcementsHome">
		<h3>Announcements</h3>
		<table class="announcements">
	<tr>
		<td colspan="2" class="headseparator">&nbsp;</td>
	</tr>


			<tr class="title">
					<td class="title"><h4>Accreditation Update: SINTA 3</h4></td>
					<td class="more">&nbsp;</td>
		</tr>
		<tr class="description">
			<td class="description"><p>We are pleased to announce that <em>Ars: Jurnal Seni Rupa dan Desain</em> has been re-accredited at SINTA 3, based on <strong>Keputusan Direktur Jenderal Riset dan Pengembangan Kementerian Pendidikan Tinggi, Sains, dan Teknologi Nomor 156/C/C3/KPT/2026 tentang Peringkat Akreditasi Baru Jurnal Ilmiah Peringkat 3 sampai 6 Periode 2 Tahun 2025</strong>, dated 7 April 2026.</p><p>The official decree can be accessed at: <a title="SINTA 3" href="https://arjuna.kemdiktisaintek.go.id/#/pengumuman/710" target="_blank">https://arjuna.kemdiktisaintek.go.id/#/pengumuman/710</a><br />(see Appendix number 65/<em>Lampiran nomor 65</em>).</p><p>We extend our sincere gratitude to all authors, reviewers, and editorial board members whose contributions have made this achievement possible.</p></td>
			<td class="more">&nbsp;</td>
		</tr>
		<tr class="details">
			<td class="posted">Posted: 2026-04-10</td>
					</tr>
		<tr>
		<td colspan="2" class="endseparator">&nbsp;</td>
	</tr>
	
</table>	
		<table class="announcementsMore">
			<tr>
				<td><a href="https://journal.isi.ac.id/index.php/ars/announcement">More Announcements...</a></td>
			</tr>
		</table>
	</div>

